      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like a breakup though. it's more like... i've been erased. everything i did to try and fix it just made it worse. i see them hanging out and laughing and i just know that if i walked up to them, they'd look right through me. there is no fixing this. the bridge is just gone. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of existing while everyone else has moved on without me. how am i even supposed to \"explore new activities\" when I can't even exist in a room with people?",
